,"user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T19:09:24-07:00","id":721421,"title":"","content":"Or...the silver fangs would start hunting them again for that sweet succulent spit roasted grondr taste.<br /> <br /> (Sorry. I always wondered if that house of the Silver Fangs that goes unnamed after being wiped out by gaia herself for their deeds against another changing breed was for not only wiping out the wereboars but for eating them too. Suckling Grondr style. I can totally see some mad ages old SF types holding hunting parties and feasts for that. Anyhoo)<br /> <br /> I too think if a pack of Elder Grobdr turned up they could certainly be a boon with all they could do, teach and possibly create more kin to continue the line in a couple of generations...but then...that would be why the Wyrm would attack them with everything it had to stomp that out quick. Painting a huge target and bounty on their hides and anyone that aided or sided with them.<br /> <br /> but if you want to do it in your game and have it start something new and different I say go for it. Just for the players to have had that once in a life time chance is probably worth it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T20:03:34-07:00","id":721475,"title":"","content":"If gaia didn't want a breed wiped out it shouldn't have been made of Bacon or Steak. Notice how well the Ratkin thrive.. by this logic of course Bats must be delicious!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T20:15:58-07:00","id":721581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/714730-bane-tenders-would-have-been-rendered-obsolete-by-grondr?p=721475#post721475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If gaia didn't want a breed wiped out it shouldn't have been made of Bacon or Steak. Notice how well the Ratkin thrive.. by this logic of course Bats must be delicious!</div> </div> </div> </div>now I want a double Apis and maple cured Grondr whopper with fries and a shake.<br /> <br /> and thats a fair point ^-^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-23T22:11:49-07:00","id":721835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/714730-bane-tenders-would-have-been-rendered-obsolete-by-grondr?p=720749#post720749\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Probably not. You'd probably use up all the Grondir before hitting all The tended Banes. Though it would mean more Uktena can be directed at active threats!</div> </div> </div> </div>How would it use up the Grondr. The process of digestion can be a matter of minutes if the Grondr wants it to be.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T04:14:31-07:00","id":722551,"title":"","content":"Cause maybe the wyrm isn't just going to sit there and take it? Maybe the Triadic Wyrm, especially the Eater of Souls and the Defiler have a few tricks up their many tentacled sleeves for creatures of hunger looking to consume it great quantities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T06:35:07-07:00","id":722785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/714730-bane-tenders-would-have-been-rendered-obsolete-by-grondr?p=716726#post716726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Boars are not native to the Western Hemisphere so Uktena would still have to do their thing if Grondir never were wiped out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, it's not like moon bridges (or airplanes, for that matter) can only be used by Garou.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3118-cifer","name":"Cifer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3118_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T14:54:52-07:00","id":724234,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/714730-bane-tenders-would-have-been-rendered-obsolete-by-grondr?p=721835#post721835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How would it use up the Grondr. The process of digestion can be a matter of minutes if the Grondr wants it to be.</div> </div> </div> </div>Uktena have alot of things tied down. Many on par with the Storm Eater. I'd imagine that might be abit much unless you have hundreds of Grondir<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cifer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/714730-bane-tenders-would-have-been-rendered-obsolete-by-grondr?p=722785#post722785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, it's not like moon bridges (or airplanes, for that matter) can only be used by Garou.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>There don't seem to have been any Moon Bridges to the Western hemisphere before the second War of Rage. I mean honestly a divergent timeline could have all sorts of other setup, but presuming the Grondir survived in Europe and Asia it makes sense someone might need to still cover for them in the Americas.<br /> <br /> If they popped out of the Umbra today? Well there's Wild boar in america now!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T16:53:35-07:00","id":724483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_contain